job-name-tau-earth-caste = Fio'la
job-name-tau-air-caste = Kor'la
job-name-tau-water-caste = Por'la

job-description-tau-earth-caste = Fio'la: a junior builder and technician of the Earth Caste, attached to the cadre with practical pulse arms to keep its war effort supplied, maintained, and fortified.
job-description-tau-air-caste = Kor'la: a junior member of the Air Caste, serving the cadre as a pilot and explorer while relying on mobile pulse fire to survive the frontier.
job-description-tau-water-caste = Por'la: a junior administrator, diplomat, and merchant of the Water Caste, seconded to the cadre to manage liaison and logistics while armed for self-defence.
